---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';

const directionsUrl = 'https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=Vascon+Mariplex+Mall%2C+Cybage+Tower+Road%2C+Kalyani+Nagar%2C+Pune+411014';
---
<Base
  title="How to Reach The Elite Spa Centre in Kalyani Nagar, Pune"
  description="Find The Elite Spa Centre at Vascon Mariplex Mall, Kalyani Nagar. Route guidance for guests from Koregaon Park, Viman Nagar, Kharadi, Yerwada and across Pune."
>
  <main class="pt-32 sm:pt-40 pb-20 sm:pb-28">
    <section class="max-w-[1380px] mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8">
      <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-[#B0AEA6] mb-8">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-[#D4AF37]">Home</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
        <span class="text-[#F5F5F0]">Nearby Pune Areas</span>
      </nav>

      <div class="max-w-4xl mb-14">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.22em] uppercase text-[#D4AF37] mb-4">Getting here · Pune</p>
        <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-medium text-[#F5F5F0] leading-[1.04] mb-6">Find your way to our <em class="italic font-normal text-[#D4AF37]">Kalyani Nagar</em> spa.</h1>
        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-[#B0AEA6] leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">The Elite Spa Centre has one physical location: Ground Floor, Vascon Mariplex Mall, Cybage Tower Road, next to Taco Bell, Marigold Complex, Kalyani Nagar, Pune 411014. This guide helps guests travelling from other parts of Pune identify the correct destination and check their route before setting out.</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-[#B0AEA6] leading-relaxed mt-4 max-w-3xl">We do not operate branches in the neighbourhoods listed below or promise fixed journey times. Travel time depends on your starting point, route and current traffic, so use live directions for your trip.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row flex-wrap gap-3 mt-8">
          <a href={directionsUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 py-4 rounded-full bg-[#D4AF37] hover:bg-[#E8CB6D] text-[#09090B] text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.1em] uppercase transition-colors">Check route on Google Maps ↗</a>
          <a href="/booking/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 py-4 rounded-full border border-[#D4AF37]/40 hover:border-[#D4AF37] text-[#F5F5F0] text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.1em] uppercase transition-colors">Enquire about an appointment</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5 mb-16">
        <article class="glass-panel rounded-3xl p-7 sm:p-8">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-[#D4AF37] mb-3">Nearby neighbourhoods</p>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#F5F5F0] mb-4">East Pune neighbourhoods</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#B0AEA6] leading-relaxed mb-5">Guests coming from Koregaon Park, Viman Nagar or Wadgaon Sheri can set Vascon Mariplex Mall, Kalyani Nagar as the destination and compare the live route from their exact starting point.</p>
          <ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs text-[#F5F5F0]/85">
            <li class="rounded-full bg-[#09090B]/70 border border-[#F5F5F0]/10 px-3 py-2">Koregaon Park</li>
            <li class="rounded-full bg-[#09090B]/70 border border-[#F5F5F0]/10 px-3 py-2">Viman Nagar</li>
            <li class="rounded-full bg-[#09090B]/70 border border-[#F5F5F0]/10 px-3 py-2">Wadgaon Sheri</li>
          </ul>
        </article>

        <article class="glass-panel rounded-3xl p-7 sm:p-8">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-[#D4AF37] mb-3">IT parks & business districts</p>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#F5F5F0] mb-4">Workday visits</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#B0AEA6] leading-relaxed mb-5">Travelling from Kharadi? EON IT Park and World Trade Center are useful area references. From Yerwada, you may be starting near Commerzone or Business Bay. Check the route and enquire before travelling.</p>
          <ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs text-[#F5F5F0]/85">
            <li class="rounded-full bg-[#09090B]/70 border border-[#F5F5F0]/10 px-3 py-2">Kharadi</li>
            <li class="rounded-full bg-[#09090B]/70 border border-[#F5F5F0]/10 px-3 py-2">EON IT Park</li>
            <li class="rounded-full bg-[#09090B]/70 border border-[#F5F5F0]/10 px-3 py-2">World Trade Center</li>
            <li class="rounded-full bg-[#09090B]/70 border border-[#F5F5F0]/10 px-3 py-2">Yerwada</li>
            <li class="rounded-full bg-[#09090B]/70 border border-[#F5F5F0]/10 px-3 py-2">Commerzone</li>
            <li class="rounded-full bg-[#09090B]/70 border border-[#F5F5F0]/10 px-3 py-2">Business Bay</li>
          </ul>
        </article>

        <article class="glass-panel rounded-3xl p-7 sm:p-8">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-[#D4AF37] mb-3">Wider Pune</p>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#F5F5F0] mb-4">Plan with live directions</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#B0AEA6] leading-relaxed mb-5">Guests may also travel from Mundhwa, Magarpatta City, Hadapsar, Camp, MG Road, Bund Garden, Dhanori or Lohegaon. These are different parts of Pune, so check the live route from your own starting point.</p>
          <ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs text-[#F5F5F0]/85">
            <li class="rounded-full bg-[#09090B]/70 border border-[#F5F5F0]/10 px-3 py-2">Mundhwa</li>
            <li class="rounded-full bg-[#09090B]/70 border border-[#F5F5F0]/10 px-3 py-2">Magarpatta City</li>
            <li class="rounded-full bg-[#09090B]/70 border border-[#F5F5F0]/10 px-3 py-2">Hadapsar</li>
            <li class="rounded-full bg-[#09090B]/70 border border-[#F5F5F0]/10 px-3 py-2">Camp & MG Road</li>
            <li class="rounded-full bg-[#09090B]/70 border border-[#F5F5F0]/10 px-3 py-2">Bund Garden</li>
            <li class="rounded-full bg-[#09090B]/70 border border-[#F5F5F0]/10 px-3 py-2">Dhanori</li>
            <li class="rounded-full bg-[#09090B]/70 border border-[#F5F5F0]/10 px-3 py-2">Lohegaon</li>
          </ul>
        </article>
      </div>

      <section class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-start mb-16">
        <div class="lg:col-span-5">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-[#D4AF37] mb-3">Your destination</p>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-[#F5F5F0] leading-tight mb-4">The Elite Spa Centre, Vascon Mariplex Mall</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#B0AEA6] leading-relaxed">Ground Floor, Vascon Mariplex Mall, Cybage Tower Road, next to Taco Bell, Marigold Complex, Kalyani Nagar, Pune, Maharashtra 411014.</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#B0AEA6] leading-relaxed mt-4">The website lists daily opening hours as 8:00 AM–3:00 AM. Appointment availability is not guaranteed by the opening hours alone; send an enquiry and wait for the centre to confirm.</p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mt-6">
            <a href={directionsUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#D4AF37] hover:text-[#E8CB6D]">Open directions ↗</a>
            <a href="/contact/" class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#D4AF37] hover:text-[#E8CB6D]">Contact the centre ↗</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="lg:col-span-7 rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border border-[#D4AF37]/25 bg-[#121215] min-h-[340px]">
          <iframe title="Map to The Elite Spa Centre, Vascon Mariplex Mall, Kalyani Nagar, Pune" src="https://www.google.com/maps?q=Vascon+Mariplex+Mall,+Cybage+Tower+Road,+Kalyani+Nagar,+Pune+411014&z=15&output=embed" loading="lazy" referrerPolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade" class="w-full h-[340px] border-0" />
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="border-t border-[#D4AF37]/20 pt-14 mb-16">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-[#D4AF37] mb-3">Choose a ritual</p>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-[#F5F5F0] mb-4">Explore spa services in Kalyani Nagar</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-[#B0AEA6] max-w-3xl leading-relaxed mb-7">Before sending an appointment enquiry, review the treatment details and listed starting rates. Final rates and appointment availability are confirmed by the centre.</p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-3">
          <a href="/services/swedish/" class="rounded-2xl border border-[#F5F5F0]/10 bg-[#121215] hover:border-[#D4AF37]/50 p-5 text-sm text-[#F5F5F0] transition-colors">Swedish Massage <span class="block text-xs text-[#B0AEA6] mt-1">60 minutes · listed from ₹999</span></a>
          <a href="/services/deep-tissue/" class="rounded-2xl border border-[#F5F5F0]/10 bg-[#121215] hover:border-[#D4AF37]/50 p-5 text-sm text-[#F5F5F0] transition-colors">Deep Tissue Massage <span class="block text-xs text-[#B0AEA6] mt-1">60 minutes · listed from ₹999</span></a>
          <a href="/services/aromatherapy/" class="rounded-2xl border border-[#F5F5F0]/10 bg-[#121215] hover:border-[#D4AF37]/50 p-5 text-sm text-[#F5F5F0] transition-colors">Aromatherapy Massage <span class="block text-xs text-[#B0AEA6] mt-1">60 minutes · listed from ₹999</span></a>
          <a href="/services/couples/" class="rounded-2xl border border-[#F5F5F0]/10 bg-[#121215] hover:border-[#D4AF37]/50 p-5 text-sm text-[#F5F5F0] transition-colors">Couples Spa Ritual <span class="block text-xs text-[#B0AEA6] mt-1">60 minutes · listed from ₹1,999 per couple</span></a>
          <a href="/services/hot-stone/" class="rounded-2xl border border-[#F5F5F0]/10 bg-[#121215] hover:border-[#D4AF37]/50 p-5 text-sm text-[#F5F5F0] transition-colors">Hot Stone Massage <span class="block text-xs text-[#B0AEA6] mt-1">75 minutes · listed from ₹1,399</span></a>
          <a href="/services/" class="rounded-2xl border border-[#F5F5F0]/10 bg-[#121215] hover:border-[#D4AF37]/50 p-5 text-sm text-[#D4AF37] transition-colors">View all 26 listed services ↗ <span class="block text-xs text-[#B0AEA6] mt-1">Browse the full treatment menu</span></a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="max-w-4xl border-t border-[#D4AF37]/20 pt-14">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-[#D4AF37] mb-3">Good to know</p>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-[#F5F5F0] mb-8">Travel and booking questions</h2>
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <article>
            <h3 class="font-serif text-xl text-[#F5F5F0] mb-2">Do you have branches in Koregaon Park, Viman Nagar or Kharadi?</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-[#B0AEA6] leading-relaxed">No. The Elite Spa Centre has one physical location at Vascon Mariplex Mall in Kalyani Nagar, Pune. Koregaon Park, Viman Nagar, Wadgaon Sheri, Kharadi, Yerwada and the other neighbourhoods on this page are places guests may travel from; they are not branches or service locations.</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <h3 class="font-serif text-xl text-[#F5F5F0] mb-2">How long will it take to reach the spa?</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-[#B0AEA6] leading-relaxed">We do not quote a fixed travel time. The journey depends on your exact starting point, time of day and traffic. Open the Google Maps directions link for a current estimate before travelling.</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <h3 class="font-serif text-xl text-[#F5F5F0] mb-2">What are the opening hours?</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-[#B0AEA6] leading-relaxed">The official website lists daily hours as 8:00 AM–3:00 AM. Please enquire to confirm appointment availability for your preferred date and time.</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <h3 class="font-serif text-xl text-[#F5F5F0] mb-2">Can guests travelling from Kharadi, EON IT Park or Yerwada enquire about a late-night visit?</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-[#B0AEA6] leading-relaxed">The website lists daily opening hours as 8:00 AM–3:00 AM. Choose your treatment and preferred time on the booking page; the centre will confirm whether that appointment is available. Opening hours do not guarantee an open slot.</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <h3 class="font-serif text-xl text-[#F5F5F0] mb-2">Can I visit from Koregaon Park, Viman Nagar or Wadgaon Sheri?</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-[#B0AEA6] leading-relaxed">Yes. Please set Vascon Mariplex Mall, Kalyani Nagar as your destination and check live directions from your exact starting point. We do not quote a fixed journey time because routes and traffic change.</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <h3 class="font-serif text-xl text-[#F5F5F0] mb-2">Does the booking page confirm my appointment?</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-[#B0AEA6] leading-relaxed">No. The booking page sends an enquiry to the centre on WhatsApp. Your appointment is confirmed only after the centre replies with availability and final details.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3">
          <a href="/booking/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-4 rounded-full bg-[#D4AF37] hover:bg-[#E8CB6D] text-[#09090B] text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.1em] uppercase transition-colors">Enquire about a visit</a>
          <a href={directionsUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-4 rounded-full border border-[#D4AF37]/40 hover:border-[#D4AF37] text-[#F5F5F0] text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.1em] uppercase transition-colors">Get directions ↗</a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </section>
  </main>
</Base>
